    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You witnessed or lived through a vampire attack. Perhaps you fought in it, or perhaps you were frozen in terror by what you saw. Either way, you stay alert for monsters and pride yourself on being prepared for anything: no vampire will catch you or your companions off guard again.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Dexterity, Constitution, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.pF0gQV6no5QeWlZH]{Vampire Hunter}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Insight and Religion</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulWoodcarver]{Woodcarver's Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulWoodcarver]{Woodcarver's Tools}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagCrowbar0000]{Crowbar}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagLanternHood]{Hooded Lantern}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbhsyReliquaryh]{Holy Symbol} (reliquary), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagHolyWater00]{Holy Water}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagMirror00000]{Mirror}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagOil00000000]{Oil} (3 flasks), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTinderbox00]{Tinderbox}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagWaterskin00]{Waterskin}, 4 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
